WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:02.620
A heart stops during an operation.

2
00:00:02.670 --> 00:00:05.120
Minutes later, it starts again.

3
00:00:05.170 --> 00:00:08.210
The patient wakes and
describes leaving their body,

4
00:00:08.260 --> 00:00:11.420
a tunnel, and a bright, loving light.

5
00:00:11.470 --> 00:00:17.400
In 1975, a book called Life After
Life made stories like this famous.

6
00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:20.320
So can anyone show there
is life after death,

7
00:00:20.370 --> 00:00:22.790
or is it only a comforting hope?

8
00:00:22.840 --> 00:00:25.940
In this mission, you'll
weigh near-death experiences,

9
00:00:25.990 --> 00:00:29.060
and children who say they
remember a past life.

10
00:00:29.110 --> 00:00:33.170
Then you'll hear the case against,
and weigh which side is stronger.

11
00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:38.110
Your mission: weigh up the evidence on
both sides of the life-after-death debate.
